s</span><span data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-1-2-1-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"closing date text\">Closes November 14, 2026</span></p>\n<p class=\"mt-2 text-[14px] leading-[1.43] text-[#333]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-1-2-1-1-1-3\" data-name=\"survey description text\">Employment status, job level, sector, and monthly income range.</p>\n</div>\n<a class=\"mt-0.5 inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1 text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#0066cc]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-1-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"respond link\" href=\"#\">Respond<i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-chevron-right\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-1-2-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"chevron right icon\"></i></a>\n</div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"py-5\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"survey article list item\">\n<div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-6\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"survey item row layout\">\n<div class=\"min-w-0\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"survey details container\">\n<h3 class=\"text-[17px] font-semibold leading-[1.3]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-1-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"survey title heading\">Employment Outcomes Follow-up</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-1.5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 text-[13px] text-[#7a7a7a]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-1-2-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"survey meta line\"><span data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-1-2-2-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"question count text\">11 questions</span><span data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-1-2-2-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"closing date text\">Closes December 5, 2026</span></p>\n<p class=\"mt-2 text-[14px] leading-[1.43] text-[#333]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-1-2-2-1-1-3\" data-name=\"survey description text\">Current employment, months to first employment, and course relevance.</p>\n</div>\n<a class=\"mt-0.5 inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1 text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#0066cc]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-1-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"respond link\" href=\"#\">Respond<i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-chevron-right\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-1-2-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"chevron right icon\"></i></a>\n</div>\n</article>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section aria-labelledby=\"jobs-lane\" class=\"rounded-[18px] border border-[#e0e0e0] bg-white p-6\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"jobs section\">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"jobs section header row\">\n<h2 class=\"text-[21px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.011em]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"jobs section heading\" id=\"jobs-lane\">Jobs</h2>\n<a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#0066cc]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"browse all jobs link\" href=\"#\">Browse all jobs<i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-chevron-right\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"chevron right icon\"></i></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-3 border-t border-[#e0e0e0]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"jobs list container\">\n<article class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-6 border-b border-[#f0f0f0] py-4\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"job article list item\">\n<div class=\"min-w-0\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"job details container\">\n<h3 class=\"text-[17px] font-semibold leading-[1.3]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"job title heading\">Data Analyst</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-1 text-[14px] text-[#333]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"company name text\">San Miguel Corporation</p>\n<p class=\"mt-1.5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 text-[13px] text-[#7a7a7a]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2-2-1-1-3\" data-name=\"job meta line\"><span data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2-2-1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"employment type text\">Full-time</span><span data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2-2-1-1-3-2\" data-name=\"location text\">Pasig City</span><span data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2-2-1-1-3-3\" data-name=\"apply deadline text\">Apply by November 20, 2026</span></p>\n</div>\n<a class=\"mt-0.5 inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1 text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#0066cc]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"view role link\" href=\"#\">View role<i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-chevron-right\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"chevron right icon\"></i></a>\n</article>\n<article class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-6 border-b border-[#f0f0f0] py-4\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"job article list item\">\n<div class=\"min-w-0\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"job details container\">\n<h3 class=\"text-[17px] font-semibold leading-[1.3]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"job title heading\">Junior Software Engineer</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-1 text-[14px] text-[#333]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"company name text\">Accenture</p>\n<p class=\"mt-1.5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 text-[13px] text-[#7a7a7a]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2-2-2-1-3\" data-name=\"job meta line\"><span data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2-2-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"employment type text\">Full-time</span><span data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2-2-2-1-3-2\" data-name=\"location text\">Cebu City</span><span data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2-2-2-1-3-3\" data-name=\"apply deadline text\">Apply by November 30, 2026</span></p>\n</div>\n<a class=\"mt-0.5 inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1 text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#0066cc]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"view role link\" href=\"#\">View role<i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-chevron-right\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"chevron right icon\"></i></a>\n</article>\n<article class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-6 py-4\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"job article list item\">\n<div class=\"min-w-0\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"job details container\">\n<h3 class=\"text-[17px] font-semibold leading-[1.3]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"job title heading\">Research Assistant</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-1 text-[14px] text-[#333]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"company name text\">UP Diliman</p>\n<p class=\"mt-1.5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 text-[13px] text-[#7a7a7a]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2-2-3-1-3\" data-name=\"job meta line\"><span data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2-2-3-1-3-1\" data-name=\"employment type text\">Contract</span><span data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2-2-3-1-3-2\" data-name=\"location text\">Quezon City</span><span data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2-2-3-1-3-3\" data-name=\"apply deadline text\">Apply by December 1, 2026</span></p>\n</div>\n<a class=\"mt-0.5 inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1 text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#0066cc]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"view role link\" href=\"#\">View role<i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-chevron-right\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"chevron right icon\"></i></a>\n</article>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n<aside aria-labelledby=\"announcements-lane\" class=\"rounded-[18px] border border-[#e0e0e0] bg-white p-6\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3\" data-name=\"announcements sidebar\">\n<h2 class=\"text-[21px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.011em]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-1\" data-name=\"announcements section heading\" id=\"announcements-lane\">Announcements</h2>\n<div class=\"mt-3 border-t border-[#e0e0e0]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2\" data-name=\"announcements list container\">\n<article class=\"border-b border-[#f0f0f0] py-5\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"announcement article list item\">\n<p class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 text-[13px] text-[#7a7a7a]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"announcement meta line\">\n<span data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"announcement date text\">October 27, 2026</span>\n<span data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"announcement category label\">Academic</span>\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[#333]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-1-1-3\" data-name=\"pinned indicator\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-pin\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"pin icon\"></i>Pinned</span>\n</p>\n<h3 class=\"mt-2 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-[1.3]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-1-2\" data-name=\"announcement title heading\">Tracer survey for batch 2021 opens November 3</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-2 text-[14px] leading-[1.47] text-[#333]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-1-3\" data-name=\"announcement body text\">The 2026 Graduate Tracer Survey opens on November 3 and closes on November 14. Responses are submitted through the alumni portal and are not visible to other graduates.</p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"py-5\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"announcement article list item\">\n<p class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 text-[13px] text-[#7a7a7a]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"announcement meta line\">\n<span data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"announcement date text\">October 21, 2026</span>\n<span data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"announcement category label\">Events</span>\n</p>\n<h3 class=\"mt-2 text-[17px] font-semibold leading-[1.3]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"announcement title heading\">Alumni homecoming set for December 12</h3>\n<p class=\"mt-2 text-[14px] leading-[1.47] text-[#333]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-2-3\" data-name=\"announcement body text\">The homecoming will be held at the university gymnasium on December 12, starting at 4:00 PM. Registration closes on December 5.</p>\n</article>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n</main>\n<footer class=\"mt-auto border-t border-[#e0e0e0]\" data-kid=\"1-4\" data-name=\"footer bar\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-[1440px] items-center px-8 py-4 text-[12px] text-[#7a7a7a]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1\" data-name=\"footer inner content row\">\n<span data-kid=\"1-4-1-1\" data-name=\"footer product name text\">Alumni Tracer Management System</span>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>",
