      "html": "<div class=\"flex min-h-screen flex-col bg-[#f5f5f7] text-[#1d1d1f] antialiased\" data-kid=\"1\" data-name=\"page layout container\" style=\"font-family:'Inter',system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;font-feature-settings:'ss03'\">\n<style>\n@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap');\n@import url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/lucide-static@1.48.0/font/lucide.css');\n</style>\n<header class=\"bg-black\" data-kid=\"1-1\" data-name=\"top app header bar\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto flex h-14 max-w-[1440px] items-center gap-3 px-8\" data-kid=\"1-1-1\" data-name=\"header content row\">\n<span class=\"grid size-7 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-[6px] bg-white text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-tight text-black\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"app logo mark\">AT</span>\n<a class=\"truncate text-[13px] text-white\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"app name link\" href=\"#\">Alumni Tracer Management System</a>\n<div class=\"ml-auto flex items-center gap-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-3\" data-name=\"header actions group\">\n<button aria-label=\"Notifications, 2 unread\" class=\"relative grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-full text-[18px] text-white/85\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"notifications toggle button\" type=\"button\">\n<i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-bell\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"bell icon\"></i>\n<span class=\"absolute right-2 top-2 grid min-w-[15px] place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#0066cc] px-1 text-[9px] font-semibold leading-[15px] text-white tabular-nums\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"unread count badge\">2</span>\n</button>\n<button aria-label=\"Account menu\" class=\"grid size-8 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#d2d2d7] text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#1d1d1f]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-3-2\" data-name=\"account avatar menu button\" type=\"button\">D</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header>\n<nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\" class=\"border-b border-[#e0e0e0]\" data-kid=\"1-2\" data-name=\"main top navigation bar\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto flex h-[52px] max-w-[1440px] items-center gap-1 px-8\" data-kid=\"1-2-1\" data-name=\"navigation tab row\">\n<a aria-current=\"page\" class=\"rounded-[8px] bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#1d1d1f]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"active dashboard nav link\" href=\"#\">Dashboard</a>\n<a class=\"rounded-[8px] px-3 py-1.5 text-[12px] text-[#333]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"my profile nav link\" href=\"#\">My profile</a>\n<a class=\"rounded-[8px] px-3 py-1.5 text-[12px] text-[#333]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"notifications nav link\" href=\"#\">Notifications</a>\n<a class=\"rounded-[8px] px-3 py-1.5 text-[12px] text-[#333]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-4\" data-name=\"surveys nav link\" href=\"#\">Surveys</a>\n<a class=\"rounded-[8px] px-3 py-1.5 text-[12px] text-[#333]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-5\" data-name=\"jobs nav link\" href=\"#\">Jobs</a>\n</div>\n</nav>\n<main class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-20 pb-16 pt-8\" data-kid=\"1-3\" data-name=\"main dashboard content\">\n<div class=\"flex h-16 items-baseline justify-between gap-6\" data-kid=\"1-3-1\" data-name=\"page heading row\">\n<h1 class=\"text-[40px] font-semibold leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.022em]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"page title heading\">Dashboard</h1>\n<p class=\"text-[17px] text-[#7a7a7a]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"program and batch subtitle\">BS Information Technology · Batch 2021</p>\n</div>\n<section aria-label=\"Your alumni record\" class=\"flex min-h-[152px] items-center gap-5 rounded-[18px] border border-[#e0e0e0] bg-white px-6 py-5\" data-kid=\"1-3-2\" data-name=\"alumni profile summary card\">\n<img alt=\"Danica R. Manalo\" class=\"size-[88px] shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"profile avatar image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/160?u=danica-manalo\"/>\n<div class=\"w-[190px] shrink-0\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"profile identity block\">\n<h2 class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-[22px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-[-0.015em]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"alumni full name heading\">Danica R. Manalo</h2>\n<p class=\"mt-1.5 truncate text-[17px] leading-[1.3] text-[#333]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"job title text\">Data Analyst</p>\n<p class=\"mt-0.5 truncate text-[14px] text-[#7a7a7a]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3\" data-name=\"employer name text\">San Miguel Corporation</p>\n</div>\n<dl class=\"grid grow grid-cols-[minmax(150px,1.4fr)_1fr_1fr_1fr] gap-5\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3\" data-name=\"profile detail list\">\n<div data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-1\" data-name=\"program detail cell\">\n<dt class=\"text-[13px] text-[#7a7a7a]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"program label\">Program</dt>\n<dd class=\"mt-1 text-[15px] font-semibold leading-[1.3]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"program value text\">BS Information Technology</dd>\n</div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2\" data-name=\"graduation year detail cell\">\n<dt class=\"text-[13px] text-[#7a7a7a]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"graduation year label\">Graduation year</dt>\n<dd class=\"mt-1 text-[15px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"graduation year value\">2021</dd>\n</div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-3\" data-name=\"graduate record detail cell\">\n<dt class=\"text-[13px] text-[#7a7a7a]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-3-1\" data-name=\"graduate record label\">Graduate record</dt>\n<dd class=\"mt-1 text-[15px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-3-2\" data-name=\"record status value\">Verified</dd>\n</div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-4\" data-name=\"profile status detail cell\">\n<dt class=\"text-[13px] text-[#7a7a7a]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-4-1\" data-name=\"profile status label\">Profile</dt>\n<dd class=\"mt-1 text-[15px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-4-2\" data-name=\"profile completeness value\">Complete</dd>\n</div>\n</dl>\n<div class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center gap-4\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-4\" data-name=\"profile action links\">\n<a class=\"flex h-11 items-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-full bg-[#0066cc] px-5 text-[14px] font-semibold text-white\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-4-1\" data-name=\"edit profile button link\" href=\"#\">Edit profile</a>\n<a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#0066cc]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-4-2\" data-name=\"update career link\" href=\"#\">Update career</a>\n</div>\n</section>\n<div aria-label=\"Content categories\" class=\"mt-6 inline-flex rounded-full bg-[#f0f0f0] p-1\" data-kid=\"1-3-3\" data-name=\"content category tab list\" role=\"tablist\">\n<button aria-selected=\"true\" class=\"h-9 rounded-full bg-white px-5 text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#1d1d1f]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1\" data-name=\"announcements active tab\" role=\"tab\" type=\"button\">Announcements</button>\n<button aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"h-9 rounded-full px-5 text-[14px] text-[#333]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-2\" data-name=\"surveys tab\" role=\"tab\" type=\"button\">Surveys</button>\n<button aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"h-9 rounded-full px-5 text-[14px] text-[#333]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-3\" data-name=\"jobs tab\" role=\"tab\" type=\"button\">Jobs</button>\n</div>\n<section aria-labelledby=\"selected-announcement\" class=\"mt-7 rounded-[18px] border border-[#e0e0e0] bg-white px-8 py-8\" data-kid=\"1-3-4\" data-name=\"announcement detail card\">\n<div class=\"max-w-[680px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1\" data-name=\"featured announcement content\">\n<p class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1 text-[13px] text-[#7a7a7a]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-1\" data-name=\"announcement meta row\">\n<span data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-1-1\" data-name=\"published date text\">October 27, 2026</span>\n<span data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-1-2\" data-name=\"category tag\">Academic</span>\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[#333]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-1-3\" data-name=\"pinned status label\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-pin\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"pin icon\"></i>Pinned</span>\n</p>\n<h2 class=\"mt-3 text-[28px] font-semibold leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.02em]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-2\" data-name=\"announcement headline\" id=\"selected-announcement\">Tracer survey for batch 2021 opens November 3</h2>\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-[17px] leading-[1.47] text-[#333]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-3\" data-name=\"announcement paragraph one\">The 2026 Graduate Tracer Survey opens on November 3 and closes on November 14. The instrument covers employment status, job level, sector, monthly income range, and course relevance. Responses are submitted through the alumni portal and are not visible to other graduates.</p>\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-[17px] leading-[1.47] text-[#333]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-4\" data-name=\"announcement paragraph two\">Graduates who do not submit by the closing date keep access to the survey for the next cycle. Questions about the instrument can be sent to the alumni office.</p>\n</div>\n<details class=\"mt-8 border-t border-[#e0e0e0]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-2\" data-name=\"collapsed announcement item\">\n<summary class=\"flex min-h-[72px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-6\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-2-1\" data-name=\"announcement item summary header\">\n<span class=\"min-w-0\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"collapsed title and meta text\">\n<span class=\"block text-[17px] font-semibold leading-[1.3]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"collapsed announcement title\">Alumni homecoming set for December 12</span>\n<span class=\"mt-1 block text-[13px] text-[#7a7a7a]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"collapsed announcement date and category\">October 21, 2026 · Events</span>\n</span>\n<i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-chevron-down shrink-0 text-[14px] text-[#7a7a7a]\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-2-1-2\" data-name=\"expand chevron icon\"></i>\n</summary>\n</details>\n</section>\n</main>\n<footer class=\"mt-auto border-t border-[#e0e0e0]\" data-kid=\"1-4\" data-name=\"page footer bar\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-[1440px] items-center px-8 py-4 text-[12px] text-[#7a7a7a]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1\" data-name=\"footer content row\">\n<span data-kid=\"1-4-1-1\" data-name=\"footer app name text\">Alumni Tracer Management System</span>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>",
