-1\" data-name=\"survey title\">Employment Outcomes Follow-up</span>\n<span class=\"mt-1 flex items-center gap-2 text-[12px] text-[#7a7a7a]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-5-2\" data-name=\"survey meta row\"><span data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-5-2-1\" data-name=\"question count label\">11 questions</span><span data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-5-2-2\" data-name=\"survey closing date\">Closes December 5, 2026</span></span>\n</button>\n<p class=\"flex h-6 items-center px-3 text-[12px] text-[#7a7a7a]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-6\" data-name=\"announcements section header\">Announcements</p>\n<button class=\"flex h-[88px] w-full flex-col justify-center rounded-[8px] px-3 text-left\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-7\" data-name=\"announcement record card\" type=\"button\">\n<span class=\"line-clamp-2 text-[15px] font-semibold leading-[1.3]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-7-1\" data-name=\"announcement title\">Tracer survey for batch 2021 opens November 3</span>\n<span class=\"mt-1 flex items-center gap-2 text-[12px] text-[#7a7a7a]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-7-2\" data-name=\"announcement meta row\"><span data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-7-2-1\" data-name=\"announcement category tag\">Academic</span><span data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-7-2-2\" data-name=\"announcement date\">October 27, 2026</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-pin\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-7-2-3\" data-name=\"pinned indicator icon\"></i></span>\n</button>\n<button class=\"flex h-[88px] w-full flex-col justify-center rounded-[8px] px-3 text-left\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-8\" data-name=\"announcement record card\" type=\"button\">\n<span class=\"line-clamp-2 text-[15px] font-semibold leading-[1.3]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-8-1\" data-name=\"announcement title\">Alumni homecoming set for December 12</span>\n<span class=\"mt-1 flex items-center gap-2 text-[12px] text-[#7a7a7a]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-8-2\" data-name=\"announcement meta row\"><span data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-8-2-1\" data-name=\"announcement category tag\">Events</span><span data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-8-2-2\" data-name=\"announcement date\">October 21, 2026</span></s